1010	/* Live controls — sit directly above the schedule they shape; every change
1011	   re-plans instantly. Day hours + meal breaks are also draggable on the graphic. */
1012	/* Three groups side by side, each a fieldset with its question as the legend;
1013	   they stack into one column when the row can't hold them. "Your day" gets the
